00:13:58,430 --> 00:14:00,590
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>百褶不撓的匠人神態</b></font>

268
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:14,110
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>史萊姆 你們認識嗎</b></font>

269
00:14:14,620 --> 00:14:16,860
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>凱金先生 就是這隻史萊姆呀</b></font>

270
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:19,170
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>{\an5}矮人三兄弟</b></font>

271
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:19,170
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>{\an5}次男 多爾德     三男 米魯德     長子 葛洛姆</b></font>

272
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:20,290
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>昨天救了我們</b></font>

273
00:14:21,870 --> 00:14:23,360
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>是這樣啊</b></font>

274
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:27,630
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>非常感謝</b></font>

275
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:34,550
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>沒有沒有 沒這麼偉大又好像挺偉大的嘿嘿嘿</b></font>

276
00:14:35,220 --> 00:14:37,380
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>然後 有何貴幹呢</b></font>

277
00:14:40,140 --> 00:14:42,630
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>原來如此 事情大概知道了</b></font>

278
00:14:43,390 --> 00:14:46,230
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>但是對不起了 我現在正忙得慌</b></font>

279
00:14:46,980 --> 00:14:50,310
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>某個笨蛋大臣 給了個亂來的訂單</b></font>

280
00:14:50,820 --> 00:14:52,060
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>亂來的訂單?</b></font>

281
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:58,570
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>說是可能要發生戰爭 讓我這週內做完20把長劍</b></font>

282
00:14:59,410 --> 00:15:02,740
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>我才剛做出一把長劍 材料就用完了</b></font>

283
00:15:03,580 --> 00:15:06,570
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>那就說做不到 拒絕掉不就好了嗎</b></font>

284
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:07,750
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>是啊</b></font>

285
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:12,500
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>蠢貨 我一開始也說了做不到了</b></font>

286
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:15,420
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>然後那個混蛋培斯塔大臣</b></font>

287
00:15:16,180 --> 00:15:17,260
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>哦呀哦呀</b></font>

288
00:15:16,600 --> 00:15:21,650
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b><font size="60">{\an4}培斯塔大臣</font></b></font>

289
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:21,600
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>沒想到聞名王國的鍛造師凱金大人</b></font>

290
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:24,430
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>連這點程度的工作都完成不了嗎</b></font>

291
00:15:24,690 --> 00:15:28,850
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>我能允許他這樣胡說八道嗎 那個混蛋</b></font>

292
00:15:29,610 --> 00:15:31,770
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>部長也是這樣的感覺呢</b></font>

293
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:35,690
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>不管哪個世界 人際關係都很麻煩呢</b></font>

294
00:15:36,530 --> 00:15:37,860
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>你說材料不夠了是嗎</b></font>

295
00:15:38,370 --> 00:15:42,530
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>是的 需要一種叫做魔礦石的特殊礦石</b></font>

296
00:15:42,870 --> 00:15:45,200
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>雖然昨天我們去挖了</b></font>

297
00:15:45,710 --> 00:15:47,700
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>但是盔甲龍突然出現了</b></font>

298
00:15:48,790 --> 00:15:49,540
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這樣啊</b></font>

299
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:53,460
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>不過那個礦山也差不多被挖空了</b></font>

300
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,460
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>大概已經沒有了</b></font>

301
00:15:56,890 --> 00:16:03,470
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>然而就算材料夠了 20把劍起碼也要兩週左右</b></font>

302
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:09,230
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>現在卻只剩下五天就要送貨到王那邊</b></font>

303
00:16:09,730 --> 00:16:13,900
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>而且這是國家分配給各個匠人的工作</b></font>

304
00:16:14,150 --> 00:16:17,140
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>如果沒完成可能要被剝奪匠人的資格</b></font>

305
00:16:17,570 --> 00:16:18,320
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>大哥</b></font>

306
00:16:18,990 --> 00:16:20,570
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>還真是讓人困惱呢</b></font>

307
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:27,080
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>啊嘞 我不是有魔礦石嗎</b></font>

308
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:36,660
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>老闆</b></font>

309
00:16:40,430 --> 00:16:42,170
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這個能用嗎</b></font>

310
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:54,110
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這不是魔礦石嗎 而且還是難以置信般的高純度</b></font>

311
00:16:56,950 --> 00:17:00,190
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>喂喂老闆 你的眼睛是窟窿嗎</b></font>

312
00:17:03,950 --> 00:17:09,120
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>哇 這是已經加工好的魔礦塊而不是魔礦石</b></font>

313
00:17:08,380 --> 00:17:10,590
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b><font size="60">魔礦塊</font></b></font>

314
00:17:09,870 --> 00:17:10,450
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>正解</b></font>

315
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:13,620
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這樣的話甚至可以做出更高品質的劍</b></font>

316
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:16,960
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>怎麼會這樣 這一大整塊</b></font>

317
00:17:18,130 --> 00:17:22,550
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這能讓給我嗎 當然我會給個好價錢的</b></font>

318
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:25,640
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>該怎麼辦好呢</b></font>

319
00:17:26,720 --> 00:17:29,890
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>你想要什麼 只要是我能做得到的什麼都行</b></font>

320
00:17:30,730 --> 00:17:32,810
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>就等著你這句話呢</b></font>

321
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:45,320
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>希望能找個老闆的熟人</b></font>

322
00:17:45,490 --> 00:17:49,080
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>願意作為技術顧問來我們村子的</b></font>

323
00:17:52,080 --> 00:17:53,660
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>只要這樣就行了嘛</b></font>

324
00:17:54,340 --> 00:17:58,330
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>對我們來說最優先的就是衣食住的衣和住</b></font>

325
00:17:58,840 --> 00:18:02,750
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>今後的衣服籌備和武器之類的也想要拜託你</b></font>

326
