<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>哼 小事一樁</b></font>

327
00:18:08,430 --> 00:18:12,100
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>但是 就算現在開始做劍也…</b></font>

328
00:18:14,020 --> 00:18:15,010
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>來得及嗎</b></font>

329
00:18:15,690 --> 00:18:18,430
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>嘛 只能做多少是多少了</b></font>

330
00:18:18,780 --> 00:18:20,610
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>準備開工了</b></font>

331
00:18:25,030 --> 00:18:27,780
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>對了 大賢者 能打擾一下嘛</b></font>

332
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:28,770
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>好的</b></font>

333
00:18:31,370 --> 00:18:32,450
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>吶 老闆</b></font>

334
00:18:33,540 --> 00:18:36,950
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>把剛才說做好的那把劍給我看看</b></font>

335
00:18:42,050 --> 00:18:43,460
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這真是厲害啊</b></font>

336
00:18:43,970 --> 00:18:47,630
