337
00:18:48,970 --> 00:18:50,470
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這把劍看起來也發著光呢</b></font>

338
00:18:51,310 --> 00:18:53,720
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>因為用魔鋼做了核心</b></font>

339
00:18:55,400 --> 00:19:00,480
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>簡單來說就是能跟著使用者的想像成長的劍</b></font>

340
00:19:00,570 --> 00:19:02,210
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>真厲害</b></font>

341
00:19:02,410 --> 00:19:06,150
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>真厲害呢 不知道這位老闆能來我們村子裡嗎</b></font>

342
00:19:06,410 --> 00:19:08,400
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>為此</b></font>

343
00:19:08,830 --> 00:19:10,080
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這把劍借我一下</b></font>

344
00:19:13,660 --> 00:19:15,250
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>劍被 什麼</b></font>

345
00:19:18,170 --> 00:19:19,160
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>利姆路老爺</b></font>

346
00:19:19,750 --> 00:19:22,590
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>稍微等等 大賢者解析一下</b></font>

347
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:25,510
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>解析對象 長劍</b></font>

348
00:19:26,590 --> 00:19:27,500
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>成功</b></font>

349
00:19:28,260 --> 00:19:30,920
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>使用魔礦塊進行複製</b></font>

350
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:35,010
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>製作複製品 成功</b></font>

351
00:19:46,950 --> 00:19:50,440
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>魔礦塊的長劍 20把完成</b></font>

352
00:19:55,790 --> 00:19:56,450
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>慶祝?</b></font>

353
00:19:57,540 --> 00:20:00,120
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>多虧了你的幫忙 納品順利搞定了</b></font>

354
00:20:00,460 --> 00:20:02,450
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>沒必要特地慶祝啦</b></font>

355
00:20:02,800 --> 00:20:06,380
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>嘛嘛 有很多漂亮的精靈小姐姐哦</b></font>

356
00:20:06,380 --> 00:20:06,960
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>精靈</b></font>

357
00:20:07,390 --> 00:20:09,800
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>沒錯沒錯 有一家叫做夜之蝶的店</b></font>

358
00:20:09,890 --> 00:20:13,970
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>從少女到熟女應有盡有 紳士的不二之選</b></font>

359
00:20:14,060 --> 00:20:15,020
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>蝶…</b></font>

360
00:20:15,560 --> 00:20:16,390
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>倒是說話啊</b></font>

361
00:20:17,650 --> 00:20:20,140
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>要是利姆路老爺不來的話 慶祝會可就開不起來了</b></font>

362
00:20:20,230 --> 00:20:20,720
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>沒錯沒錯</b></font>

363
00:20:21,320 --> 00:20:24,150
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>嘛 都說到這個地步的話 真拿你們沒辦法</b></font>

364
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:31,150
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>真是一群讓人困擾的傢伙們呢</b></font>

365
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:40,570
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>啊啦 凱金先生歡迎光臨</b></font>

366
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:42,580
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>歡迎光臨</b></font>

367
00:20:45,170 --> 00:20:45,660
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>精靈</b></font>

368
00:20:47,180 --> 00:20:47,760
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>精靈</b></font>

369
00:20:49,180 --> 00:20:51,850
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>色靈 不對 精靈</b></font>

370
00:20:52,680 --> 00:20:54,670
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>哇 好可愛</b></font>

371
00:20:55,930 --> 00:20:57,590
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>來了</b></font>

372
00:20:58,850 --> 00:21:01,600
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>喂 明明是我先看上的</b></font>

373
00:21:01,940 --> 00:21:04,600
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>糟糕 衣服好薄啊</b></font>

374
00:21:04,690 --> 00:21:06,930
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>一彈一彈真舒服</b></font>

375
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:09,440
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>舒服的是我這裡</b></font>

376
00:21:12,280 --> 00:21:15,450
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這就是女性胸部的觸感</b></font>

377
00:21:16,120 --> 00:21:20,280
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>人生第一次 這就是樂園嗎</b></font>

378
00:21:20,710 --> 00:21:24,870
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>嘴上不願意 身體還是很誠實的嘛</b></font>

379
00:21:26,550 --> 00:21:27,960
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>也沒那麼…</b></font>

380
00:21:34,310 --> 00:21:36,050
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>來喝起來吧</b></font>

381
00:21:36,310 --> 00:21:37,640
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>好的</b></font>

382
00:21:39,730 --> 00:21:42,470
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這時的我彷彿置身於天堂之中</b></font>

383
00:21:43,980 --> 00:21:46,640
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>想就這樣一直生活在這雙峰之間</b></font>

384
00:21:48,900 --> 00:21:52,070
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這是何等美妙的雙峰人生啊</b></font>

385
00:21:54,410 --> 00:21:58,070
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>但是快樂的時間無法持續太久</b></font>

386
00:21:59,410 --> 00:22:01,830
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這也是 人生</b></font>

387
00:22:17,250 --> 00:22:22,340
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>為什麼 只持有唯一的希望</b></font>

388
00:22:17,250 --> 00:22:22,340
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>どうして　希望を持つひとだけ</b></font>

389
00:22:22,820 --> 00:22:28,020
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>內心只知道絕望</b></font>

390
00:22:22,820 --> 00:22:28,020
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>心に　絶望を知るのだろう</b></font>

391
00:22:28,610 --> 00:22:33,530
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>為什麼 只持有唯一的勇氣</b></font>

392
00:22:28,610 --> 00:22:33,530
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>どうして　勇気を持つひとだけ</b></font>

393
00:22:33,530 --> 00:22:38,870
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>名譽的盡頭 只是傷痕累累</b></font>

394
00:22:33,530 --> 00:22:38,870
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>名誉の果てに　傷を負うのだろう</b></font>

395
00:22:39,370 --> 00:22:44,970
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>對於悲傷的事物 不願低頭面對</b></font>

396
00:22:39,370 --> 00:22:44,970
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>悲しい出来事に　目を伏せたくなくて</b></font>

397
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:50,500
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>全新的黎明 被稱為夢想之物</b></font>

398
00:22:45,000 --> 00:22:50,500
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>新しい夜明けを　夢と名付けてみせた</b></font>

399
00:22:50,650 --> 00:22:56,350
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>扭曲的夜晚之間 降下了光明</b></font>

400
00:22:50,650 --> 00:22:56,350
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>ねじれた　夜の隙間に　光がおちる</b></font>

401
00:22:57,310 --> 00:23:02,810
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>連上天都哭泣了</b></font>

402
00:22:57,310 --> 00:23:02,810
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>空が泣いているよ</b></font>

403
00:23:03,310 --> 00:23:05,890
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>世界的盡頭</b></font>

404
00:23:03,310 --> 00:23:05,890
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>世界の果て</b></font>

405
00:23:05,900 --> 00:23:08,980
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>有什麼 雖然不知道</b></font>

406
00:23:05,900 --> 00:23:08,980
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>なんて　知らないけれど</b></font>

407
00:23:08,980 --> 00:23:14,650
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>這雙手所觸及的地方 我想守護</b></font>

408
00:23:08,980 --> 00:23:14,650
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>この手が届く場所は　守りたくて</b></font>

409
00:23:14,660 --> 00:23:20,900
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>戰鬥的理由 僅凝視唯一一點</b></font>

410
00:23:14,660 --> 00:23:20,900
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>戦う理由　ひとつ　睨みつけた</b></font>

411
00:23:20,910 --> 00:23:27,580
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>作為能夠彼此諒解的答案 我們</b></font>

412
00:23:20,910 --> 00:23:27,580
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>許しあうことの　答えになる　僕らは</b></font>

413
00:23:28,170 --> 00:23:32,750
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>絕不認輸</b></font>

414
00:23:28,170 --> 00:23:32,750
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>負けちゃいけない</b></font>

415
00:23:32,750 --> 00:23:32,750
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b></b></font>

416
00:23:36,010 --> 00:23:39,850
<font face="FZZhunYuan-M02" size="68"><b>下集 英雄王蓋札·德瓦崗</b></font>

417
